This update corrects flaws in the following subsystems:
  - ARM64 architecture;
  - PA-RISC architecture;
  - PowerPC architecture;
  - S390 architecture;
  - x86 architecture;
  - Compute Acceleration Framework;
  - Ublk userspace block driver;
  - Bluetooth drivers;
  - ARM SCMI message protocol;
  - GPU drivers;
  - IOMMU subsystem;
