  - PCI subsystem;
  - PTP clock framework;
  - SPI subsystem;
  - BTRFS file system;
  - SMB network file system;
  - eXpress Data Path;
  - Universal MIDI packet (UMP) support module;
  - Tracing infrastructure;
  - Memory management;
  - IPv4 networking;
  - IPv6 networking;
  - Network traffic control;
  - AMD SoC Alsa drivers;
  - SoC Audio generic drivers;
